WEBVTT

00:02:29.996 --> 00:02:31.996
And then, telling me this story,

00:02:31.996 --> 00:02:33.996
Frankie said,

00:02:33.996 --> 00:02:35.996
"You know ... God,

00:02:35.996 --> 00:02:38.996
drugs really make you stupid."

00:02:39.996 --> 00:02:42.996
And, you know, you can't fault him for accuracy.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:45.996
But, actually, Frankie, at that time,

00:02:45.996 --> 00:02:47.996
was a heroin addict and he was in jail.

00:02:47.996 --> 00:02:49.996
So his choice was either

00:02:49.996 --> 00:02:52.996
to accept that dirty needle or not to get high.

00:02:52.996 --> 00:02:54.996
And if there's one place you really want to get high,

00:02:54.996 --> 00:02:56.996
it's when you're in jail.

00:02:56.996 --> 00:02:58.996
But I'm a scientist

00:02:58.996 --> 00:03:00.996
and I don't like to make data out of anecdotes,